+
+## API access and audit (schema 3)
+
+- `apiKeys` contains `{ key, name, role }` records. Roles are `viewer`,
+  `cook`, and `manager`. Upgrading older files adds an empty key list;
+  provision keys in the data file before using the API.
+- `audit` is append-only and contains `{ time, name, method, path, status }`
+  entries for HTTP requests that save data. `time` is an ISO instant and
+  `name` is the API key name; secret keys are never recorded.
+- The data change and audit entry are saved together once per request.
